{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-04T16:30:56.441Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"bed13a5c835cb1797604de67","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-04T16:30:56.441Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-04T16:30:56.440Z","author":"pi-glm","text":"Starting the persisted loop slice. Plan: (1) extract the bandit adapter's single-generation step (collection observations, REINFORCE update, held-out means, gate verdict) so the persisted controller reuses one numerical kernel; (2) add a pure loop module (config parsing with hard bounds, deterministic next-config derivation from evaluation results, promotion score builders, metric-event builders); (3) refactor registerEnvironment/registerGeneration/promoteGeneration/startRun into reusable cores; (4) expose runRlLoop as a typed SDK function plus the pm rl loop run command; (5) end-to-end tests incl. two-branch lossless merge; (6) manual CLI demo in a scratch pm project."}]}],"before_hash":"561a2fecfa0d06ac76924e3d3d50f13f88c57346abca6c5b419d680bc81db566","after_hash":"cf4da12932ae359e5f621a6b9a7be7c18dcacb36c2446739f8fa9be45f57878c","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"737d84f519c1c47cfa1aa93ceea517d6c21b05d1386f1ec0c7091c1a2dc24324"}
